 128| **Rules:**
 129| - Identify the **2 to 4 most important behaviors** of the cahier des 
charges. Don't test everything, but test the core.
 130| - For animations/async with puppeteer_evaluate: use the `async () => { 
await ...; }()` IIFE pattern. With evaluate_script: use the `async () => { 
await ...; }` declaration pattern. Wait INSIDE the script before checking.
